⨯ duplicate-bounds: @range cannot be used together with @max
  @ test.idl:3:6

 2 │ struct Foo {
 3 │     @range(min = 0, max = 100)
   │      ˆˆˆˆˆ @range annotation here
 4 │     @max(50)
   │      ˆˆˆ @max annotation here
 5 │     int32 value;
 6 │ };

  ? use either @range or @min/@max, not both
